# Same logic as bank-app's per-Dockerfile ignore. The repo-root
# .dockerignore is tuned for JVM service images and excludes
# bases/bank-console + infra/docker by default; this file
# whitelists the bits this Dockerfile actually copies.
*

!bases/bank-console
!infra/docker/bank-console

# SignIn.svelte ?raw-imports a handful of ADRs, TDDs, and recipes
# via `../../../../docs/…`. Whitelist just those three subtrees so
# the build context stays small (docs/slides is ~500MB locally with
# its node_modules cache, and docs/prd / docs/plan aren't referenced).
!docs/adr
!docs/tdd
!docs/recipes

bases/bank-console/node_modules
bases/bank-console/dist
bases/bank-console/.svelte-kit
bases/bank-console/**/*.log
